<title>UK: Kyushu Electric Power sets $300 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kyushu Electric Power sets $300 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KYUSHU ELECTRIC POWER CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    16.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+37 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
